    "hidden": false,
    "keepTogether": false,
    "startOnNewPage": false,
    "content": "<p>Backend Python engineer in Málaga. +3 years of professional experience and production projects. I build REST APIs with FastAPI, PostgreSQL, Redis, and SQLAlchemy for systems that have to stay consistent under concurrent requests and retries. Applied AI starts with ReckonFlow: structured LLM outputs through a closed schema, deterministic validation in code, and no authority for the model to approve or pay. I work from written specs, with AI-assisted coding and a human merge. Currently a vocational master's in AI and big data (100% online, compatible with full-time work) and preparing official cloud certifications (GCP, AWS). DAW with honors (Matrícula de Honor), EQF Level 5. Open to remote or hybrid backend and applied-AI roles.</p>"
  },
