        {
          "id": "d4000001-0001-4000-8000-000000000003",
          "hidden": false,
          "name": "ReckonFlow",
          "period": "Aug 2026",
          "website": {
            "url": "https://github.com/ikrame-ih/reckon-flow",
            "label": "GitHub",
            "inlineLink": true
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "label": "GitHub",
              "url": "https://github.com/ikrame-ih/reckon-flow"
            },
            {
              "label": "Docs",
              "url": "https://reckon-flow.onrender.com/docs"
            }
          ],
          "description": "<p>Headless FastAPI REST API for corporate travel. Relational PostgreSQL database, Redis, immutable double-entry ledger, Decimal money. Production deployment with interactive docs.</p><ul><li>Redis idempotency and PostgreSQL row locks (FOR UPDATE) so a retried confirm cannot double-post. Asynchronous processing via HTTP 202 background jobs.</li><li>Receipt extraction with PydanticAI and Groq. Closed schema extra=forbid as a guardrail against prompt injection; structured LLM outputs are validated in code before any database write. The model cannot approve or pay.</li><li>Hybrid retrieval (RAG-style): SQL prefilter, RapidFuzz, hashed-token vectors, Reciprocal Rank Fusion. Unit testing with pytest, CI/CD, Prometheus observability.</li></ul>"
        },
        {
          "id": "d4000001-0001-4000-8000-000000000007",
          "hidden": false,
          "name": "Validata",
          "period": "2026 - Present",
          "website": {
            "url": "",
            "label": "",
            "inlineLink": false
          },
          "description": "<p>Co-developed B2B SaaS. Batch lookup of Spanish companies by razón social against official BORME records. FastAPI, Celery distributed workflows, Redis, PostgreSQL, React. Original file columns are preserved on export.</p><ul><li>Company-name column inference, atomic Redis quotas, HMAC download tokens, Stripe test Checkout, waitlist persistence, GitHub Actions CI.</li><li>Legal-form mismatch (S.L. vs S.A.) stays REVISION_SUGERIDA.</li></ul>"
        },
