          "description": "<p>DAW capstone, grade 10/10. Game library with React, Node.js/Express, PostgreSQL, JWT, Docker Compose. Vitest on client and server.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "d4000001-0001-4000-8000-000000000006",
          "hidden": true,
          "name": "Málaga Onboarding",
          "period": "2026 - Present",
          "website": {
            "url": "",
            "label": "",
            "inlineLink": false
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "label": "Live",
              "url": "https://malaga-onboarding.pages.dev/"
            }
          ],
          "description": "<p>Guide for PTA expats relocating to Málaga. Production plan API is a deterministic topological sort - no LLM on the user path (0€ inference). Operator-only LangGraph.js CLI verifies JSON fact sheets locally.</p><ul><li>Four-node graph with typed GraphState: researcher (Groq claims) → source finder (DuckDuckGo site-limited search, fetch + Cheerio) → fact checker (verified / uncertain / potentially_inaccurate) → editor (draft from official evidence only).</li><li>Conditional routing: medium/high risk short-circuits to HUMAN_REVIEW_REQUIRED. No cross-run memory; each invoke is one sheet. Tool calling, prompt guardrails, Groq.</li></ul>"
        },
